K (npc:188252) |SID||1| |N|Kill (npc:188252) (61.50,39.10)<br/><br/>Do not get hit by avoidable damage. Don't step in the center of (spell:372851) or on icicles left over from (spell:384024)<br/>Control the whelps. Mass stuns and disorients are great, but single-target interrupting (spell:373803) is also really helpful.<br/>Quickly burn through (spell:373688). This always lines up with whelps, so do not be afraid to save cool downs for it.<br/><br/>Tank: Track your own stacks of (spell:372682). Be aware that you will very rapidly gain stacks every minute when the Whelps are out - this is an ideal time for cool downs and abilities such as (spell:48707).<br/><br/>Healer: Triage your group for (spell:372682) proactively:<br/><b>Dispel on cool down.<br/><b>Prioritize targets with high stacks of (spell:372682), the tank just before Whelps are about to spawn, or people about to be frozen.<br/>This one is obvious, but - make sure you can see and easily dispel the stacks of (spell:372682) on your User Interface.| |NPC|188252| |F|2095| -|SID|54032|
K (npc:189232) |SID||2| |N|Kill (npc:189232) (39.62,42.75)<br/><br/>When (npc:189232) is about to reach 100 energy, position yourself away from the path, away from where your tank will take the boss next, and preferably close to other fire puddles (but not in them). At 100 energy, (npc:189232) starts casting (spell:372863) and snapshots a player's location for it. This spawns an immobile (npc:189886) there.<br/><br/>Tank: You have the entire ring to play with. Position yourself, the boss and your group smartly. There is no reason to play risky games in positioning - and it tends to lead to player deaths if you do.<br/><b>Always position yourself so the boulders spawned by (spell:372811) roll outwards into the walls of the ring. The last thing you want is for your path to be blocked because you rolled a boulder down the path.<br/><b>Rotate cool downs for (spell:372858)<br/><b>Help your DPS with the Firestorms. This will also allow them to cleave, but remember that (spell:372811) will still happen!<br/><br/>Prepare cool downs for every (spell:372863) - the spell itself deals heavy party-wide damage. In addition, (spell:384823) deals heavy damage to all players as long as they are active, and any missed kicks on (spell:373017) will exacerbate things even more. They spawn roughly every 30 seconds.<br/><b>Do not be near (npc:189886)'s if you can avoid it - they will explode when they die. This explosion is avoidable, but will force you to move at a time where you will have other, more pressing priorities.<br/><b>Pay slightly more attention to the tank when (spell:372858) is applied to them.| |NPC|189232| |Z|2094| |F|2094|
